# Project-specific management workstreams. Targets are proposed management controls unless sourced.
streams=[
('A','Accountability and authority','Project Director','NOA/contract, scope split and corporate delegation','Appoint named managers and deputies; record availability and competing commitments; establish RACI; set spending/change/technical-release authority; chair weekly integration review.','Signed organisation/RACI and delegated-authority register','Named accountable owner for each control; no unidentified release authority','SCC1; Technical BEC5.2–5.4'),
('B','Baseline and requirements','Contracts Manager','Tender, addenda/corrigenda, source drawing register','Maintain clause-to-deliverable matrix; resolve SCC/GCC precedence using B-4; link revisions and deletions; isolate S&SRP references; freeze controlled scope by bridge and retain open discrepancies.','Approved requirements and scope baseline; assumption/change log','Every requirement has source, owner, verification and disposition','P8–P12; CQ replies; B-4'),
('C','Contract, qualification and compliance','Contracts Manager','Actual bidding route, experience evidence and amendments','Check110MT/marine route and consortium exceptions; retain PM/qualifying main activity; obtain subcontract commitments; verify TPI authentication and valid accreditation; reconcile financial evidence; manage securities and integrity-pact disclosures.','Qualification/compliance matrix and evidence bundle','No unsupported bidder confirmations or expired verification evidence','Technical BEC5; P9/P11'),
('D','Design basis and survey','Engineering Manager','BRRP criteria, tender GAs and survey access','Verify coordinates, elevations, spans, clearances, member sizes/thickness/loss, support movement, piping/cable loads and NDT; create controlled datums; close bearing/camber/load discrepancies; record later company instructions under change control.','Accepted survey dossier and bridge-specific design basis','Survey-derived geometry and load status visible on every engineering package','CriteriaPartII; Corrigendum3 GCC2.3.6'),
('E','Engineering and independent checking','Engineering Manager','Accepted survey, criteria, scope and discipline interfaces','Analyse bridge and supporting platforms, members/joints, bearings, fatigue/VIV, preservice lifts/transport and temporary stages; iterate piping reactions; detail connections; perform independent check and comment closure; submit through controlled DCI.','Checked calculations, interface reactions, design reports and accepted drawings','No source-study utilisation ratio represented as new design proof','C8; Combined1Annexure1; DesignCriteria'),
('F','Fabrication drawings and AFC release','Lead Structural Engineer','Accepted mother analysis and verified geometry','Issue source-to-detail mapping, shop GAs, member/cut lists, joint/weld maps, bearing/guides, padeyes/supports and temporary-stability details; apply source revisions and CRS; independent check then company/CA release as applicable.','Signed bridge-specific release index with matching drawing/MTO/procedure revisions','AFC status requires actual authorised approval and field-copy control','C8 mother documents; Combined1 pp27–41'),
('G','Geometry, MTO and weight control','Quantity/Weight Engineer','Released model/drawings and field verification','Separate new bridge, strengthening, new landing, existing landing, demolition and finish quantities; resolve1MT/2m/1m² discrepancies; calculate member-length/plate/bolt/weld/coating MTO and wastage explicitly; track module dry/wet/rigging weights and COG.','Traceable MTO revisions, reconciliation and verified module weight report','No bulk tonnage substituted for lift weight, member BOM or coating area','SOW quantity table; MTOIRT; Criteria weight/COG trigger'),
('H','HSE and SIMOPS','HSE Manager','Workfront hazards, operating platform and vessel requirements','Complete HIRA/JSA/PTW, isolation/LOTO, hot work, gas testing, work-at-height/rescue, dropped objects, scaffold/access, marine transfers, occupational exposure and emergency interfaces; train staff; issue certified PPE and validate work-start clearance.','Approved HSE/SIMOPS plan, personnel matrix and permit packs','Zero work starts without applicable permits, isolation and readiness evidence','SCC7/8; PPElist; OISD155 applicability'),
('I','Interface and operations management','Interface Manager','Platform operations, engineering and contractors','Register structural/piping/electrical/instrument/telecom/firewater interfaces; agree outage and transfer sequence; assign tie-in owners; confirm access and emergency routes; track support reactions and dimensional tolerances; resolve NQO/NOQ naming.','Signed interface agreements, outage windows and battery-limit register','No unowned interface on lookahead or lift plan','SCC1.7; Combined1/2/3'),
('J','Joint inspections and quality assurance','QA/QC Manager','Project quality plan, codes, specifications and approved ITP','Set inspection/hold/witness points; qualify welding and personnel; control heat/consumable traceability; calibrate instruments; inspect fit-up/weld/NDT/coating/dimensions; repair and close NCRs; issue releases and indexed records.','ITP, qualification dossiers, inspection releases and NCR closure','No concealed work or next-stage release through an unresolved hold point','FS2009F; FS2005Rev9; C8'),
('K','Key suppliers and procurement','Procurement Manager','Approved requisition, MTO, PS and compliant sources','Package25 procurement scopes; RFQ and technical/commercial evaluation; verify SVL12.3 status/product/location, steel melt/pour/DVA and traceability; obtain PS approvals, place authorised PO, expedite and inspect; preserve vendor-data dependencies.','PO/delivery/inspection register with quoted dates and evidence','No unpriced allowance treated as commitment; no silent substitution','SVL12.3 Combined3 pp261–341; Corr3; C8'),
('L','Logistics, loadout and preservation','Logistics Manager','Released modules, lifting/transport studies and cargo slots','Verify shore-base storage/load capacity, route permits, lifting gear and packing/preservation; produce cargo ID/weight/COG/manifests; sea fasten and inspect loadout; monitor voyage/receipt and backload; segregate quarantine and accepted stock.','Approved loadout/transport pack, manifests and receipt reports','Cargo release ties to exact module/drawing/weight revision','SCC14; C9/C10; applicable marine assurance'),
('M','Marine engineering and assurance','Marine Manager','Module envelope, vessel particulars and environmental data','Verify actual-radius crane charts, dynamics/rigging/padeyes, deck strength/stability, seafastening/voyage, positioning/mooring/DP, subsea hazards, access/POB and certificates; obtain applicable MWS/company clearances and predeployment audit.','Accepted vessel/operation assurance pack and go/no-go record','SCC5tonne transfer crane is not a bridge-lift selection criterion','SCC3/5; C9/C10; C8 starred requirements'),
('N','Network schedule and calendars','Planning Manager','Scope/quantities, approvals, capacity and supplier dates','Use one logic network with source/assumption status; model office/yard/offshore calendars, approval states and PS stages; link shared resources and completion dossiers; calculate forward/backward paths, target shortfalls and sensitivities; freeze only after validation.','Approved baseline and update narrative with calculation settings','No day-number bar chart or register labelled approved CPM','SCC2/11; C8; P14 scenario'),
('O','Offshore installation and temporary stability','Construction Manager','Approved IWP, design, loadout and operating windows','Complete preconstruction survey/access; strengthen supports before new bridge placement where required; verify temporary load paths and restraint removal order; authorise lifts, landing alignment/bearing travel and permanent connection; inspect before transfer and removal.','Signed workfront release, installation survey and inspection dossier','No bridge removal until alternate support/service sequence accepted','StructuralSOW addendum; bridge-specific approved methods'),
('P','Production and fabrication control','Fabrication Manager','Released shop packs, material, qualified personnel and capacity','Validate bay dimensions/cranes and shifts; material receipt/heat mapping; cut/form/fit/weld with distortion/camber controls; NDT/repair; dimensional survey/trial fit; coating/curing; preserve and release modules by accepted quantities.','Daily accepted output, resource hours and module release','Separate installed structural MT from purchased stock and rework','MasterPlanV3; FS2009F/2005'),
('Q','Quantity, progress and earned value','Project Controls Manager','Approved work quantities, budget and progress rules','Measure installed and accepted quantities by workpack; distinguish fabrication/install completion, certification, invoice and cash; apply C8 engineering/MCI status weights only to their contractual bases; retain e-MB/SES traceability; do not earn budget twice.','Signed measurement, progress-rule and cost-code reconciliation','EV/SPI/CPI blank where BAC/PV/AC or accepted quantities absent','SCC12; C8 review/progress rules'),
('R','Risk, contingency and recovery','Risk/Planning Manager','Risk register, driving path and resource limits','Identify causes/events/effects; score ownership and early-warning; quantify actual schedule/cost exposures when data exist; test material delays, re-reviews, vessel failure and workability; price recovery options and seek authorised decisions.','Owned mitigations, contingency and recovery decision log','No probability or P80 claim without a risk model and evidence','SCC11; P14 alternatives'),
('S','Subcontracts and retained responsibilities','Contracts Manager','BEC route, agency scope and signed commitments','Define battery limits and deliverables; retain required PM/main activities; obtain capacity/commitment letters and flow down QA/HSE/integrity obligations; manage approved agencies, claims and performance; prohibit unauthorised whole-works pass-through.','Approved responsibility split and signed subcontract evidence','Agency listing alone is not signed capacity or eligibility','A16/A17/B6; TechnicalBEC5'),
('T','Treasury, cost and cash flow','Finance Manager','Priced estimate, signed terms and actual milestones','Track budget/commitment/accrual/actual/ETC/EAC; schedule taxes, wages, charters, vendor payments, BG margins/fees/releases, certification/payment lags, retention/advance recovery and financing; extend through final account/warranty releases.','Priced control budget and funded cash forecast','Unknown inputs remain unknown; no zero-cost feasibility conclusion','P9/P11 securities; A3/A10; SCC'),
('U','Utilities and service reinstatement','Commissioning Manager','Approved tie-ins, isolations and test requirements','List every piping/cable/instrument/lighting/earthing/firewater service; verify temporary bypasses; isolate, transfer, inspect/test and restore under operations control; close pressure/leak, continuity/IR/earthing and functional tests as applicable.','System-wise reinstatement/test sheets and operations acceptance','No energisation or hydrotest without approved test boundary and procedure','Combined1/2/3 discipline specifications'),
('V','Variations, delay and claims records','Contracts Manager','Written instruction, baseline and contemporaneous records','Log notices and contractual time bars; maintain monthly joint critical-event logs and quarterly delay reports; substantiate quantities/invoices/man/barge days; apply SCC9 positive/negative valuation and avoid duplicate fees; document relief decisions.','Notices, joint statements, approved variations and final-account evidence','No assumed entitlement from a schedule overrun alone','SCC9/11; Corr3 clause2.3.6; GCC8'),
('W','Weather and workability','Marine/Planning Manager','Field metocean, forecast and vessel limits','Set engineered operating/abort limits by operation; agree forecast/lookback records and weather standby attribution; plan refuge/demob/remob and emergency triggers; preserve contemporaneous proof for qualifying monsoon relief.','Weather logs, operational decisions and seasonal resource plan','Planning blackout is not automatic contractual extension','SCC2/4; C9/C10'),
('X','Execution readiness and daily control','Construction Manager','IWP, crew/tools, quantities, materials, permits and assurance','Run6week constraint removal,14day lookahead and daily permit/readiness meetings; verify all gates and evidence IDs; record planned/accepted output and crew-hours; escalate blockers and resource clashes without bypassing safety gates.','Released daily work list, production/constraint records','Readiness requires evidence and verified scope, not eight unchecked Yes labels','Stages30–35; HSE/QA project controls'),
('Y','Yard-to-field completion and handover','Completion Manager','ITRs, drawings, tests, systems and punch categories','Create bridge/system turnover boundaries at design stage; collect manufacturing records progressively; inspect structural/bearing alignment and reinstated services; close blocking punch items; deliver as-builts/native files/vendor dossiers and scrap receipts; obtain formal acceptance.','Accepted turnover dossier and handover certificate','No completion earned solely by physical steel placement','A10; C8; SCC14; GCC completion clauses'),
('Z','Warranty, final account and lessons','Project Director','Acceptance terms, outstanding obligations and final payments','Track defect liability/warranty and insurance/security releases; resolve claims and subcontract final accounts; retain integrity-pact/record obligations; archive controlled native/PDF data and access; close lessons and verify promised performance against outcomes.','Contract closure certificate, release schedule and retained records','Physical completion, financial closure and obligation expiry are separate dates','IntegrityPact9; GCC/SCC governing periods')]
risks=[
('R01','Wrong source revision or unrelated S&SRP scope','Revised SCC/A3 not positively mapped; common platform names','Contracts','Freeze affected release and resolve applicability/precedence','PO/AFC release blocked for disputed requirement'),
('R02','Survey geometry or corrosion differs from tender','Span/elevation/thickness/support condition outside accepted model','Engineering','Survey, NDT, independent check and controlled redesign','Affected design and load-path release held'),
('R03','Steel grade/origin unavailable in lead time','Mill quote fails grade, dimensions or Melt&Pour/DVA evidence','Procurement','Qualify alternative compliant mill/section through design approval','No unauthorised substitution'),
('R04','First offshore season missed','Ready-for-installation forecast beyond15May under scenario','Planning','Stage independent releases and verify earlier supply/capacity; cost second season','Seek schedule/contract decision with evidence'),
('R05','Vessel capacity or availability fails','Crane chart, deck/stability or booking does not cover module','Marine','Engineer module envelope and qualify alternate spread','No charter/lift commitment without assurance'),
('R06','Shared crews/yard bottleneck','Weekly demand exceeds named capacity or coating/NDT queue grows','Construction','Resource loading, workfront sequencing and priced additional capacity','Escalate before lookahead freeze'),
('R07','Piping/platform movement mismatch','Stress/support reactions not accepted by structural team','Piping/Structural','Iterate movement/stiffness and supporting deck checks','Bearing/service design release held'),
('R08','Live-service loss or unsafe demolition','Isolation/bypass/temporary support not accepted','Operations','Integrated SIMOPS/transfer and staged stability review','Stop affected work; complete controlled readiness'),
('R09','NDT/coating rework or curing delays','Rejects, environment or DFT outside approved procedure','QA','Qualify process, monitor environment, inspect and repair','No loadout before release'),
('R10','Funding shortfall','Unpriced charters, unverified receipts or late certification','Finance','Priced estimate, full-life cash, committed facility and scenario stress','Spending within authorised funded ceiling'),
('R11','Measurement/payment rejection','No accepted e-MB/SES or amended milestone evidence','Controls','Contemporaneous measurements and invoice reconciliation','Correct records before billing claim'),
('R12','Emergency/weather disruption','Forecast reaches abort thresholds or vessel critical system fails','Marine/HSE','Refuge/evacuation plan, drills, stop/abort authority and reserve strategy','Record decision and personnel accountability')]
